{"user_name":"Benzy","user_username":"benzy","user_bio":"I run self-hosted n8n and mostly build things that check whether the automation is still actually working: error workflow coverage audits, stuck execution detection, and heartbeats that treat silence as the alert. The templates here come out of failures I hit on my own instance.","user_links":"https://runheartbeat.com","user_avatar":"https://gravatar.com/avatar/7db1d7095e23b9ceaff48960115440593151bed3059cbccaf12da4c8f3198caf?r=pg&d=retro&size=200","url":"https://n8nworkflows.xyz/workflows/audit-missing-error-workflows-using-the-n8n-api-and-slack-19730\n","url_n8n":"https://n8n.io/workflows/19730","nodeTypes":{"n8n-nodes-base.if":{"count":1},"n8n-nodes-base.n8n":{"count":1},"n8n-nodes-base.set":{"count":1},"n8n-nodes-base.code":{"count":1},"n8n-nodes-base.noOp":{"count":1},"n8n-nodes-base.slack":{"count":1},"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote":{"count":4},"n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger":{"count":1}},"categories":[{"id":16,"name":"DevOps"}]}